		(property "Description" "2.4 GHz WiFi (802.11 b/g/n) and Bluetooth ® 5 (LE) module Built around ESP32S3 series of SoCs, Xtensa ® dualcore 32bit LX7 microprocessor Flash up to 16 MB, PSRAM up to 8 MB 36 GPIOs, rich set of peripherals Onboard PCB antenna"
